WEBVTT

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:17.620
She’s here…

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:22.550
Get out of here!

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:35.430
Man…

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:36.690
This is crazy!

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:47.270
You’re…

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.490
The ancient covenant.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:56.410
By order of The Three Clans,

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.960
we will hereby perform a purity inspection.

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:17.730
Wait just a minute!

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:22.270
We should still have three years until the next inspection.

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:23.730
Why now?

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:25.690
It’s fine, Vera.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:30.490
I knew these three would put me up to this.

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:33.990
Do as you wish.

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:46.250
Then what about the “husband” thing that The Three Clans were talking about?

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:47.000
It’s the truth.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:54.920
In order to sustain the blood of the royals, Her Majesty must wed with one of the three and bear a child.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:57.800
Come on.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:01.720
You didn’t actually believe you could be with her forever, did you?

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:03.890
That’s…

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.270
No, of course you didn’t.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:10.520
You and Her Majesty were born under different stars.

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:13.530
You two will never become one.

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.240
What’s the Princess doing now?

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.120
Her Majesty is in the middle of her own battle.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:24.450
It should have begun by now.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:28.170
A purity inspection?!

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:29.420
That’s right.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:36.050
In order to see if Her Royal Highness has a pure body worthy of being the Queen.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.180
That’s…!

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:39.930
That’s… like being lynched.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.600
Under the pretense of an inspection, they are trying to teach Her Royal Highness her place.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.940
“You belong to us alone.”

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.870
Stigma is being sprayed.

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.740
I’m closing the hood.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:14.420
Why does the Princess have to endure something like that?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:15.960
What good would knowing that do?

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:16.590
Please!

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:22.890
A long time ago, there was a large conflict within the vampire society.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:27.480
Several clans caused an uprising against the Royal Family.

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:30.810
They were Rozenmann, Li, and Ivanovic—The Three Clans.

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.770
They took over all the other clans swiftly and easily,

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.400
and then began their invasion of Țepeș Castle.

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.410
Their Castle was burned and they were chased out of their territory.

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.660
In the end, even Queen Lucretia…

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.620
…would end up falling by their hands.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:50.920
But even the Three Clans couldn’t allow the bloodline to come to an end,

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.670
so sparing only Her Majesty, they intend to use her as the womb to carry their descendants.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.760
And every ten years, they force her to undergo a purity inspection.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.220
It’s been many centuries since then.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.930
With the development of the artificial blood known as “stigma,”

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:10.720
we have been freed from our fate of sucking human blood,

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:13.770
changing how we affiliate with mankind.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:17.400
We’re at the dawn of a new era, where darkness and light are becoming one.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.900
Or perhaps it’s the twilight of the previous era.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:23.020
This era created extremists like Telomere,

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:27.540
where vampires and humans join forces, trying to preserve the purity of their own species.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:32.000
But on the other hand, it did allowed Her Royal Highness to establish this Bund.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.130
But the old chains keep Her Majesty bound,

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:38.500
and The Three Clans put her in her place with each inspection.

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:45.390
They allow her to keep her title as Queen, but one day, her body will fall into their hands…

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:54.150
That’s how they attempt to control Her Royal Highness, down to her very soul.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.730
Princess…

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.280
I showed you a rather distasteful scene.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:02.780
Forgive me.

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:06.160
This is the true figure of the Vampire Queen.

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:07.990
Ridiculous, is it not?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:08.910
Just horrible…

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:11.160
Doing this was beyond cruelty!

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:12.660
We should tell Akira-kun—

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.670
You must not.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:18.040
I don’t want… Akira to know…

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.170
…this side… of me…

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.220
Akira-kun could do something about it!

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:26.220
You mustn’t dream.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:28.970
There is nothing he could do by himself—

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:29.850
There is!

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:32.810
I mean…

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:37.190
He thinks of you more than anyone else in the world.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:42.110
Princess?

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:47.370
I just recalled… the day I first met him.

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:51.040
That time seven or so years ago?

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.960
No, ten years prior to that.

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:57.630
I met him when he was just born.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.590
On that day…

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:03.920
It was after an inspection, and I was all alone…

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:06.720
…and he saved me from the darkness.

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:10.260
Akira… Akira…

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.640
Where are you?

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:15.890
Please… come save me.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:21.940
The winner of the bet is whoever kills me, right?

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.070
I’ll tell you beforehand that no one’s helping you.

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.530
I don’t care.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:29.660
If fate, hatred, and insanity are the chains binding the Princess,

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.910
then I’ll obliterate them all!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.910
Those are dangerous words, boy.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:37.460
You’re saying the exact same thing as Telomere.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:42.550
During that mission one year ago, you saw a certain something.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.210
It’s true, isn’t it.

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:48.430
One last missing piece of your memory.

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.470
How do you know?

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:58.690
If your memories had completely recovered, you wouldn’t be acting like you are now.

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:03.780
Depending on how you react when you regain your memories…

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:08.070
I may be forced to side with the Three Clans.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.070
Then…

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:13.240
We’re still on the same side for now, right?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:14.660
Yeah.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.080
Then tell this to the Princess:

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.380
I won’t die.

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.340
I’ll definitely come back to you.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.590
So you’d better not lose.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.220
Very well.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.060
Here I go, Princess.

00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.020
I’m starting!

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:43.770
One…

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:44.520
Two…

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:46.020
Three…

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:47.270
Four…

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.410
Seven…

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.570
Eight…

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:53.700
Nine…

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:54.530
Ten!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.830
Are you ready?

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.080
I’m ready!

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:09.050
That look of yours never changes.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:12.140
It’s fine to pity yourself,

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:16.350
but do remember that some are shedding blood for you.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.100
You met Akira?

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.890
I have a message from the boy to Your Majesty.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:28.530
“I will definitely survive and return to you,

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:30.730
so Your Majesty mustn’t lose.”

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.360
Survive and return?

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.160
That’s what he said?

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.910
He plans to defeat every assassin sent after him.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:44.580
Fighting a one-on-three battle alone, he faces three of the best assassins…

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.630
…while he himself is just an aging dog.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.130
But he will still fight.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.010
All for you, Your Royal Highness.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.890
Akira told me… not to lose?

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:02.180
You ask me to fight… do you, Akira?

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.690
Yuki, summon Vera.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.270
O-Okay!

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:11.190
I will not be thanking you.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.830
Don’t die, boy.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.700
Sir Alfonse.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.450
Feel free to laugh.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:22.450
I’m delivering messages for a kid.

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:27.670
Telomere?

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:32.170
They seem to have placed a few of their pieces on the game board.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.470
Care to repeat what you just said?

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:39.850
I will also participate in your wager.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:45.600
I will wager that Akira will survive this battle and return to my mansion.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:50.060
My wager will undoubtedly be my body and the entirety of my future.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:53.530
My, my…

00:09:53.990 --> 00:09:56.990
It sounds like a rather risky wager.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:02.870
A wager must be risky, don’t you agree?

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:07.750
Besides, how could I face him, who is fighting for me alone, without at least doing this much?

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.460
You said that you’d wager your entirety.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.210
Would that include all of the Pure One’s inheritance?

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:17.640
Ivanovic!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:18.840
Well?

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.010
Will that also be ours?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.680
The Pure One’s inheritance?

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.100
What is he talking about?

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:26.350
Answer me!

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.030
I said the entirety.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:34.320
Do you question me?

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:35.730
Very well.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.990
Now this game is worth much more.

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:43.330
That puppy is caught in an unbreakable net we wove.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.960
He cannot tear it apart.

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.370
Let’s see how far he gets.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:56.670
Damn…

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:58.300
I can’t even get close to her.

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:01.180
Here goes…

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.810
W-Why…?

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:16.940
What the hell’s going on?

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:17.940
Why now?

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.490
Lend me your ear, Kaburagi Akira.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:24.870
I’ll give you an opportunity to live.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:29.970
You were on a secret mission led by Wolfgang one year ago,

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:32.540
and visited the ruins of Țepeș Castle, didn’t you?

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:39.760
There, you witnessed a grave secret about the Pure One’s inheritance that night.

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:42.130
What did you see?

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:46.600
Kaburagi Akira.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:47.890
What did you see?

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.400
You really are an idiot, aren’t you?

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:03.950
Meiren?

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.370
But that’s what makes you so adorable.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.820
They’re unbelievably tough…

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:38.650
These so-called vampires.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:40.530
Meiren…

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.070
You’re…

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.530
One down.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.680
This is a notice to all citizens:

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:10.100
Agents of opposing clans have infiltrated the Bund.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:15.480
Their objective is to seize and exterminate Her Royal Highness’ servant, Kaburagi Akira,

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:17.940
and it is likely that battles are taking place.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:21.940
Please refrain from going outside and remain hidden until further notice.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:27.660
Just as I thought…

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.950
You’re one of us.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.870
Yeah.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:36.040
I’m supposedly a survivor of the race that was annihilated during the uprising.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:38.880
Hey, Akira.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:43.090
Why didn’t you transform before you took this much damage?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.130
I couldn’t…

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:54.060
Damn! I really can’t!

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.020
It must have shocked you.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.320
The Princess’ betrayal, that is.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.150
Betrayal?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.280
I mean, didn’t she?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.910
Did you know she had a fiancé?

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.290
Your body doesn’t lie.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:16.870
We werewolves use our minds to transform our bodies.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:20.670
It’s an aspirin.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:23.010
It’s a little strong.

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:26.430
I… don’t think I was betrayed!

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:29.350
The Princess has been fighting all alone!

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:31.550
Even after being put to shame, she still stands!

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:36.100
But that’s because she’s the Vampire Queen.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.780
Hey, Akira.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.070
Just stop.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:53.160
Haven’t you already realized it?

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:57.700
No matter how strongly the butterfly feels, it will never be together with the flower.

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:01.040
Can you feel it?

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:03.500
My heartbeat.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.760
It’s beating, just like yours.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:15.140
No human or vampire could ever truly understand us.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.310
The only one who can truly understand you…

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.650
Who can truly love you… is me.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:58.520
No!

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:04.230
Akira…

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:28.840
You’re coming with me!

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:35.800
Akira!

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.650
Did I get her?

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.990
You’re so mean, Akira-kun.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:57.780
You damned monster…

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:03.050
I was worried sick about you all this time…

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:05.290
…yet you call me a “monster”?

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.290
The “monster” is Princess Mina.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.050
Tell me.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.050
What did you see?

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:20.810
If you tell me, I’ll let you do whatever you want with my body, Akira-kun.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.480
Stop…

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:24.810
Don’t you…

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.150
…dare taint Yuki!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.190
Don’t say that.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:30.480
Just tell me…

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.900
Akira-kun!

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:35.660
What’s wrong?!

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:36.910
Why won’t you answer?!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.410
When you played with my heart and then tossed me aside?!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:47.630
Now, spill it!

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:49.460
What did you see?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:19.530
Akira…

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.580
Princess…

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:29.620
It’s fine.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.710
It’s all right now.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.260
I shall forgive you.

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:34.130
Just tell me.

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:38.180
That’s right.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:39.130
Tell me…

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.640
…and find your peace.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:44.640
That voice…

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.730
How dare you.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.730
Wh-What’s wrong, Akira?

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.980
Don’t you recognize me?

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:55.980
That voice…

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:57.990
And that figure…

00:18:58.390 --> 00:18:59.490
How dare you…

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:03.330
…imitate them!

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:23.250
Akira…

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:25.140
Don’t die.

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.570
Despite recovering most of his memories,

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:39.860
there was still one in particular that Akira couldn’t recall.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:42.720
At that time…

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:46.220
Neither me nor Princess Mina…

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.660
…knew what it was.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:55.790
At that time, we simply prayed for Akira-kun’s safety…

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:00.730
…and waited for a distant dawn.

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.010
Princess…

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.260
Dance with the Vampire Maids.

00:20:09.260 --> 00:20:10.520
Revenge Edition!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.650
With this, Princess Mina shall be ours—

00:20:14.780 --> 00:20:16.900
Oh, did it not suit your tongue?

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.110
W-What are you doing to me?

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.910
I’m combing your hair.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.450
Let’s make you all clean!

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:24.410
Stop it!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.910
You have disrespected The Three Clans for the last time!

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:29.080
What do you think you’re doing?

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:29.670
Vera!

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.200
Do it with much more force.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:32.890
Like this!

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:33.550
Yes, ma’am!

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:35.800
The Țepeș household is scary!
